# Refactoring

## Before changing code

- Explain the plan.
- List affected files.
- Explain risks.

## During refactoring

- Preserve behavior.
- Move code before rewriting code.
- Keep commits small.
- Avoid unnecessary renaming.
- Do not introduce breaking changes.
- Keep imports clean.
- Preserve public APIs whenever possible.

## After refactoring

- Verify TypeScript builds.
- Verify imports.
- Remove dead code.
- Explain the completed changes.
